@startuml
title 用户账号生命周期状态图
scale 600 width

[*] --> Unregistered : 访问平台

state Unregistered {
    [*] --> Guest : 游客浏览
    Guest --> Registering : 点击注册
    Registering --> Guest : 取消
}

state "正常状态 (Active)" as Active {
    [*] --> Offline : 注册成功
    Offline --> Online : 登录鉴权
    Online --> Offline : 退出登录/Session过期
    Online --> Online : 修改资料/头像
}

state "受限状态 (Restricted)" as Restricted {
    state "被封禁 (Banned)" as Banned
    state "禁言中 (Muted)" as Muted
}

Unregistered --> Active : 注册/验证通过
Active --> Restricted : 违规/管理员操作
Restricted --> Active : 解封/到期
Active --> Deleted : 用户注销账号
Restricted --> Deleted : 严重违规销号

Deleted --> [*]

note right of Active
  对应需求：
  - 用户鉴权
  - 资料管理
  - 互动功能
end note

note right of Restricted
  对应需求：
  - 管理员权限控制
  - 举报管理功能
end note

@enduml